"Hide the reveal arrow with the close/detach/reconnect buttons at the middle "
"of the right edge of every split-view pane (all protocols). Close and detach "
"stay reachable from the pane menu (Shift+F10) and the sidebar"
msgstr ""
"Skrýt šipku rozbalení s tlačítky zavřít/odpojit/znovu připojit uprostřed "
